# 7. Order State Machine Reference

Use this as your lifecycle map.

```text
PENDING_PAYMENT
  -> PAID
  -> PAYMENT_FAILED
  -> EXPIRED

PAID
  -> RESTAURANT_ACCEPTED
  -> RESTAURANT_REJECTED
  -> CANCELLED

RESTAURANT_ACCEPTED
  -> PREPARING

PREPARING
  -> READY_FOR_PICKUP

READY_FOR_PICKUP
  -> DRIVER_ASSIGNED

DRIVER_ASSIGNED
  -> PICKED_UP

PICKED_UP
  -> DELIVERED

Any paid state
  -> REFUNDED if cancelled/rejected
```

